OL,4,G0600FAfrodeutsche
OL,5,     GAFRODEUTSCHE is here from 6am to
OL,6,     Gset a serene tone before the
OL,7,     Gworld wakes up, gently
OL,8,     Gsoundtracking your transition
OL,9,     Ginto the weekend.
